				},
				{
					"id": 760020709,
					"content": "「認証失敗。<color=#FF5E41FF>認証失敗</color>。<color=#FF5E41FF>認証失敗</color>。<color=#FF5E41FF>殲滅</color>。<color=#FF5E41FF>殲滅</color>。<color=#FF5E41FF>殲滅</color>。<color=#FF5E41FF>殲滅殲滅殲滅殲</color>——」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「ベルヴィル・マドモワゼル」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020710,
					"content": "#うわぁ——！{NICKNAME}、気を付けろ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020704,
					"content": "#よし、これは{M#俺}{F#私}が独り占めに…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020705
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760020705,
					"content": "そうそう！全部オイラたちで…って、ちがーう！変な言い方やめろよな！オイラたちは正義の冒険者だぞ…たぶん！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020706,
					"content": "そういえば、あいつらが奪い合ってた物って一体なんだったんだろうな？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020707
					],
